= Version 2.1 =[v21]

- Fixed the table parser on empty cells.
- New ``--width`` option.
- See the [installation notes #install].


= Version 2.0 =

- **Incompatible**: configuration moved to ``~/.tinyrc``.
- Tables accept ``||`` title rows.
  - Nested lists are allowed.
  - Up to five levels.


- Faster.

